How to Generate & View DBT Documentation (with DAG) in Browser
1️⃣ Navigate to your DBT project folder

This must be the folder that contains dbt_project.yml:

cd my_first_dbt_proj

2️⃣ Generate DBT documentation

This creates the docs files (manifest.json, catalog.json) in the target/ folder.

dbt docs generate

3️⃣ Serve the documentation

This starts a local web server and opens the browser:

dbt docs serve


If it doesn't open automatically, open this URL manually:

http://localhost:8080

4️⃣ View the DAG (Lineage Graph)

In the opened UI:

Look at the bottom-right corner (or top-right on large screens).

Click the graph / lineage icon (node tree icon).

This opens the full DAG visualization for all models.
